<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Night Race: Wrong turn</title>
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<meta name="description" content="This page is not on the map. Head back to the road.">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#080A10">
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22 viewBox=%220 0 100 100%22><text y=%22.9em%22 font-size=%2290%22>🏁</text></svg>">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Chakra+Petch:wght@300;400;600;700&family=Noto+Sans+JP:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root { --asphalt:#080A10; --panel:#10151F; --line:#1E2636; --ink:#E8ECF4; --muted:#8190A9; --muted-bright:#A4B1CC; --accent:#E8A33D; --accent-dim:rgba(232,163,61,.18); color-scheme: dark; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body { height: 100%; margin: 0; }
  body { background: var(--asphalt); color: var(--ink); font-family: "Chakra Petch", system-ui, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; overflow-x: hidden; }
  .jp { font-family: "Noto Sans JP", "Chakra Petch", sans-serif; }

  /* The road: lane lines rush toward a vanishing point */
  .road { position: fixed; inset: 0; overflow: hidden; z-index: 0; }
  .road::before { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(900px 420px at 50% 38%, rgba(232,163,61,.14), transparent 62%), radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 50% 120%, rgba(232,163,61,.06), transparent 70%); }
  .lines { position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: 0; width: 220px; height: 62vh; transform: translateX(-50%) perspective(420px) rotateX(58deg); transform-origin: bottom; overflow: hidden; }
  .lines i { position: absolute; left: 50%; width: 10px; margin-left: -5px; height: 18%; border-radius: 2px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, var(--accent)); opacity: .85; animation: rush 1.1s linear infinite; }
  .lines i:nth-child(1) { top: -18%; animation-delay: 0s; } .lines i:nth-child(2) { top: -18%; animation-delay: -.22s; } .lines i:nth-child(3) { top: -18%; animation-delay: -.44s; }
  .lines i:nth-child(4) { top: -18%; animation-delay: -.66s; } .lines i:nth-child(5) { top: -18%; animation-delay: -.88s; }
  @keyframes rush { from { transform: translateY(0); } to { transform: translateY(560%); } }
  .vignette { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 1; pointer-events: none; background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, transparent 45%, rgba(0,0,0,.72) 100%); }

  main { position: relative; z-index: 2; min-height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; padding: 32px 20px 90px; }
  .brand { letter-spacing: .34em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1rem; color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; }
  .brand i { color: var(--accent); font-style: normal; }
  .code { margin: 1.6rem 0 0; font-size: clamp(5rem, 24vw, 11rem); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: .06em; color: var(--accent); text-shadow: 0 0 42px rgba(232,163,61,.45); }
  h1 { margin: .4rem 0 .2rem; font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 5vw, 2rem); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .26em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .jp-sub { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: .3em; font-size: .85rem; }
  .lead { margin: 1.4rem auto 0; max-width: 34ch; color: var(--muted-bright); font-size: 1rem; }
  .path { margin: .9rem auto 0; max-width: 90vw; padding: .35rem .8rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; background: rgba(16,21,31,.8); color: var(--muted); font-size: .78rem; letter-spacing: .06em; word-break: break-all; }
  .go { display: inline-block; margin-top: 1.8rem; padding: .95rem 2.2rem; border-radius: 10px; background: var(--accent); color: var(--asphalt); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .3em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: .8rem; box-shadow: 0 10px 34px var(--accent-dim); transition: transform .12s ease; }
  .go:active { transform: translateY(2px) scale(.99); }
  .more { margin-top: 1.1rem; font-size: .72rem; letter-spacing: .2em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .more a { color: var(--muted-bright); text-decoration: none; margin: 0 .6rem; border-bottom: 1px solid transparent; }
  .more a:hover { color: var(--ink); border-bottom-color: var(--accent); }
  a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 4px; border-radius: 4px; }
  .foot { position: fixed; z-index: 2; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 14px; text-align: center; color: var(--muted); font-size: .66rem; letter-spacing: .24em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .lines i { animation: none; opacity: .5; } .lines i:nth-child(1){top:6%} .lines i:nth-child(2){top:26%} .lines i:nth-child(3){top:46%} .lines i:nth-child(4){top:66%} .lines i:nth-child(5){top:86%} .go { transition: none; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="road" aria-hidden="true"><div class="lines"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div>
<div class="vignette" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<main>
  <a class="brand" href="/">Night<i>·</i>Race</a>
  <p class="code" aria-hidden="true">404</p>
  <h1>You took a wrong turn</h1>
  <p class="jp-sub jp" lang="ja" aria-hidden="true">道に迷った</p>
  <p class="lead">That page is not on the map. The road you want is just back there.</p>
  <p class="path" id="path" hidden></p>
  <a class="go" href="/">Back to the road</a>
  <p class="more"><a href="/stats.html">Live stats</a><a href="/privacy.html">Privacy</a></p>
</main>
<p class="foot">Powered by PACE Corp</p>

<script>
  // Show the address that was not found, as plain text (never as HTML).
  try {
    var p = document.getElementById("path"), t = location.pathname + location.search;
    if (t && t !== "/" && t.length < 120) { p.textContent = t; p.hidden = false; }
  } catch (e) {}
</script>
</body>
</html>
